# music-model-runtime-check
owner: teknium · cadence: every 2 hours · status: SUGGESTED
**Want a loop that verifies whether a downloaded music model actually generates audio after dependency or runner changes?**

## Prompt
Check whether ACE-Step or MiniMax Music 3 can run given current MTPLX memory state and mlx_audio/soundfile availability; report exact blockers or successful output file.

## Evidence
> Beats folder is empty — the script failed before generating anything. ACE-Step couldn't load (model type not supported in mlx_audio), and then soundfile was missing.
